  [*] --> SDD_ST_21_PENDING : event schedules handler
  SDD_ST_21_PENDING --> SDD_ST_21_RUNNING : fenced lease claim
  SDD_ST_21_RETRY --> SDD_ST_21_RUNNING : due retry and valid claim
