  SDD_ST_21_RUNNING --> SDD_ST_21_RETRY : retryable error / recoverable lease<br/>ambiguity
  SDD_ST_21_RUNNING --> SDD_ST_21_FAILED : terminal or attempts exhausted
  SDD_ST_21_RUNNING --> SDD_ST_21_BLOCKED : required prerequisite unavailable
  SDD_ST_21_BLOCKED --> SDD_ST_21_RETRY : explicit policy-approved recovery
